<%# Terminal replacement for a login attempt there is no panel left to render:
    its row was pruned after the retention window, or the account it was for was
    deleted and the row detached to preserve the history. Deliberately carries no
    quotas-login-poller controller, so swapping this in stops the poll. %>
<div class="rounded-md bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 p-3">
  <p class="text-xs text-amber-800">
    This login is no longer being tracked — either its record was removed while it
    was in flight, or the account it was for was deleted. Reload the page to see
    the pool's current state, then authenticate again if an account still needs
    credentials.
  </p>
</div>
